  "Id": 3044,
  "Title": "Unified Student Orientation 2023",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "The Office of Student Experience conducted its first ever Unified Student Orientation, excluding the MBBS Program. It was also the first Orientation to be held on Campus since 2019.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Office of Student Experience - Pakistan (OSE-P) conducted its first-ever Unified Orientation Session for the Students of the School of Nursing and Midwifery, Medical College and the Institute for Educational Development. Held on February 2-3, 2023, students were welcomed to the first in-person Orientation held since 2019. Students from the MBBS programme will be welcomed on campus on February 22, 2023."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The students expressed their excitement and enthusiasm at joining the AKU family. Sessions were held throughout the two days that informed and educated them of AKU Policies and Guidelines, the Student Code of Conduct, wellness services offered and detailed information from the Registrar's Office."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Orientation began with welcome notes from the AKU Leadership, as the students heard from Dean Adil Haider, Medical College; Interim Dean Tazeen Saeed Ali, School of Nursing and Midwifery; Dean Farid Panjwani, Institute of Educational Development; and Dr Laila Akbarali, Interim Vice Provost - Student Affairs and Services and University Registrar."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The OSE-P recognizes the need for extracurricular activities. On Day Two, booths and stalls were placed that advertised nine "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Student Societies ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/students/experience/groups-events/Pages/home.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "as well as the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Student Record Office",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/registrar/Pages/home.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Student Finance Office",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/admissions/fees-and-funding/Pages/financial-assistance-pk.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Student Health and Office of Counselling and Wellness Services, and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hostels",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.aku.edu/students/Pages/accommodation-pk.aspx",
                  "target": "_blank",
                  "linktype": "url",
                  "uuid": null,
                  "anchor": null,
                  "custom": {}
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The new batch of students used the opportunity to visit the stall of their choosing to both voices their questions and concerns to academic queries as well as student societies that promote different agendas. "
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Throughout the two-day orientation, students were given a Campus Tour through a Scavenger Hunt organized by Student Synergy; a Sports Evening by the AKU Student Sports Society, and a Bonfire event by the Falah (A patient welfare organization, registered with Sindh Government, run by AKU Students). All societies undertook great efforts to ensure an entertaining and informative activity for their fellow students, which was greatly appreciated by both staff and students."
          },
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "hard_break"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
